{'symbol': 'GOOG', 'date': '2023-03-24 10:30:00', 'title': 'GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP REMINDS INVESTORS OF LOOMING DEADLINE IN THE CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST ALPHABET INC. (GOOG, GOOGL)', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP (“GPM”) REMINDS INVESTORS OF THE UPCOMING MAY 15, 2023 DEADLINE TO FILE A LEAD PLAINTIFF MOTION IN THE CLASS ACTION FILED ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED ALPHABET INC. (“ALPHABET” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: GOOG, GOOGL) SECURITIES BETWEEN FEBRUARY 4, 2020 AND JANUARY 23, 2023, INCLUSIVE (THE “CLASS PERIOD”).'}